thorizer (REST API)", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Do you have a Cognito User Pool?  -->  Cognito Authorizer (REST API)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 40904, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 87957, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "7db161abcd049fa9", "type": "text", "x": 1630, "y": 2575, "width": 1440, "height": 20, "strokeColor": "#E2E8F0", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Using HTTP API with OIDC provider?  -->  JWT Authorizer", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Using HTTP API with OIDC provider?  -->  JWT Authorizer", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 25958, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 84645, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "eaf6976f874cbabc", "type": "text", "x": 1630, "y": 2600, "width": 1440, "height": 20, "strokeColor": "#E2E8F0", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Need custom auth logic or 3rd-party tokens?  -->  Lambda Authorizer", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Need custom auth logic or 3rd-party tokens?  -->  Lambda Authorizer", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 61546, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 90874, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "5b5780cd701c92b6", "type": "text", "x": 1630, "y": 2625, "width": 1440, "height": 20, "strokeColor": "#E2E8F0", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Want simplest setup + external IdP?  -->  JWT Authorizer (HTTP API)", "fontSize